        <body>
            <div xml:id="d244">

                <pb facs="0995" n="966" xml:id="pg966"/>

                <head>244. Memorandum From the Director General of the Foreign Service and Director
                    of Personnel (Barnes) to the Executive Assistant to the Secretary of State
                        (Billings)<anchor n="1" xml:id="d244-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1980-05-27">May 27, 1980</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Minority Group Members and Women Serving in High Level Positions</item>
                </list>
                <p>Attached are the lists you requested of minority group members and women serving
                    as Ambassadors and at the Deputy Assistant Secretary level and above. I am also
                    attaching comparable lists for January 1977.</p>











                <xi:include href="d244-a1.xml" xpointer="d244-a1"/>
