    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d244-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d244-f1-content">
                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Records of the Under Secretary for Management
                    (M), 1980, Box 4, Chron May 26–June 1, 1980. No classification marking. Drafted
                    on May 21 by Barnes. Sent through Read, who did not initial the memorandum.</p>
            </note>
